<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', fontFamily: '"Source Han Sans SC","Microsoft YaHei",Arial,sans-serif' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 78, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingLeft: 56, paddingRight: 56, borderBottom: '2px solid #1E4FA8' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F2430' }}>结果三：它们各自的「看片成绩单」</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8A94A6' }}>08 / 15</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flex: 1, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', paddingLeft: 56, paddingRight: 56, paddingTop: 22, paddingBottom: 56 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#4B5563', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
            左边是模拟考里抽出来的 8 张片子，每张上面标了真实答案和模型给的分。右边是三种结构在同样 524 张上的平均成绩。
        </Text>

        <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 40, marginTop: 10 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 400, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Image src='assets/samples.png' style={{ width: 400, height: 400, objectFit: 'contain' }} />
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8A94A6', marginTop: 2 }}>
                    概率越接近 1，模型越确信是肺炎；标红的是它判错的样本。
                </Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ width: 728, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', borderBottom: '1px solid #E5E9F0', paddingBottom: 12 }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 150, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8A94A6' }}>MLP</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8A94A6' }}>1.0 万旋钮</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 40, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', fontFamily: 'Arial', lineHeight: 1, width: 130 }}>0.9928</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4B5563', width: 440, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                        什么都不懂，却靠「整体白不白」考了第二名。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', borderBottom: '1px solid #E5E9F0', paddingTop: 12, paddingBottom: 12 }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 150, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8A94A6' }}>CNN</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8A94A6' }}>7.5 万旋钮</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 40, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#B93A2B', fontFamily: 'Arial', lineHeight: 1, width: 130 }}>0.9886</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4B5563', width: 440, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                        旋钮最多、最像「正经图像模型」，却排最后。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', paddingTop: 12 }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 150, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8A94A6' }}>ViT</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8A94A6' }}>7.2 万旋钮</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 40, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', fontFamily: 'Arial', lineHeight: 1, width: 130 }}>0.9935</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4B5563', width: 440, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                        第一眼就能全局对话，成绩最高，但训练要两倍时间。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#8A94A6', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 16 }}>
                    分差只有千分之几——这也意味着下面几页的「追问」比这张成绩单更重要。
                </Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flex: 1 }} />

        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8A94A6' }}>为什么把样例图放这一页：只看分数会以为「都差不多」，看到具体错例才知道差在哪。</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 676, left: 56, width: 1168, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8A94A6' }}>MedMNIST 调参实验室 · 汇报 v2</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8A94A6' }}>08 / 15</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
